# Keeps internal/api/web/dist/ present in a fresh clone.
#
# internal/api/webui.go embeds `all:web/dist`, and go:embed is a compile-time error
# when the pattern matches nothing -- so without a tracked file here, a fresh clone
# cannot run `make backend` at all.
#
# This file lives in public/ because vite's publicDir is copied into dist/ on every
# build. A .gitkeep tracked directly under dist/ would be deleted by the build,
# which would put the tree right back into the broken state. internal/api/webui_test.go
# asserts that both copies exist and are identical.
